TI  - Local Anaesthetic Thoracoscopy for Pleural Effusion-A Narrative Review.
LID - 10.3390/healthcare10101978 [doi]
LID - 1978
AB  - The incidence of pleural disease is increasing, and interventions are crucial in 
      this subspecialist area of respiratory medicine. One of the cornerstones of 
      pleural effusion investigation and management is medical, which is also known as 
      local anaesthetic thoracoscopy. This allows fluid drainage, biopsy for diagnosis 
      and preventative measures for further fluid potential build-up. This article 
      summarises the evidence around this procedure through a narrative review of the 
      available evidence.
