TI  - Pleural cryobiopsy during local anaesthetic thoracoscopy in dry pleural 
      dissemination.
PG  - e00503
LID - 10.1002/rcr2.503 [doi]
LID - e00503
AB  - A minimally invasive thoracic intervention, such as local anaesthetic 
      thoracoscopy, can be used to collect the samples in malignant pleural lesions. 
      But cancerous pleurisy without pleural effusion, called dry pleural 
      dissemination, is considered difficult to perform thoracoscopy from concerns 
      about pleural injury. We present a diagnosed case of dry pleural dissemination 
      safely sampled using cryobiopsy using flex-rigid thoracoscope under local 
      anaesthesia.
